[agent:result]       107→def _deployment_status(d: Any) -> str:
[agent:result]       108→    """Return a best-effort status string without triggering a network call.
[agent:result]       109→
[agent:result]       110→    Deployment status in the SDK is lazy-loaded via ``.state``, which issues a
[agent:result]       111→    REST call. For the list view we avoid that — many deployments can be slow
[agent:result]       112→    — and fall back to any cached status attribute.
[agent:result]       113→
[agent:result]       114→    Args:
[agent:result]       115→        d: Deployment instance.
[agent:result]       116→
[agent:result]       117→    Returns:
[agent:result]       118→        A short human-readable status label.
[agent:result]       119→    """
[agent:result]       120→    for attr in ("status", "deployment_state", "_state"):
[agent:result]       121→        value = getattr(d, attr, None)
[agent:result]       122→        if value:
[agent:result]       123→            return str(value)
[agent:result]       124→    return "-"
